    "shiphold-find":{
        "_TYPE":"dungeon",
        "questName":"[妖精]水路船一(前导任务)",
        "questName_en_US": "[Faerie] Waterway Ship 1 (Lead)",
        "questCategory": "最新任务",
        "questCategory_en_US": "WHATS NEW",
        "_TARGETINFOLIST":[
            ["mark_auto"],
            ["leaveDung"]
        ],
        "_EOT":[
            ["town","EOT"],
            ["L1","TradeWaterway"],
            ["L2","shiphold"]
        ],
        "_SPECIALJUNK":"fairy",
        "_SPECIALJUNK_CALLBACK":"shiphold-fairy",
        "_TIPS":"注意: 请在 船一, x=4, y=25处打上标记, 并确保这是船一的唯一标记.\n\n本任务是前导任务: 重复进入水路船一并直到妖精出现.\n成功捕捉到获得了妖精杂物后, 脚本会自动切换到\"[妖精]水路船一(后续任务)\"并开始循环刷取, 之后不再回到本任务.\n请在启动前按后续任务的需求把面板配置调好, 包括但不限于\"禁止回城\", \"全自动战斗\", 或者对后续任务使用\"任务定制的配置文件\".\n\nPlease place a marker at x=4, y=25 in Ship 1, and make sure it is the only marker there.\nThis is the lead task: keep re-entering Waterway Ship 1 until the Faerie appears.\nOnce the Faerie item is obtained, the script automatically switches to \"[Faerie] Waterway Ship 1 (After)\" and starts the farming loop; it will not come back to this task.\nBefore starting, set up the panel for the follow-up task, including but not limited to \"no return to town\", \"Full Auto\", or a task-specific config file for the follow-up task."
    },

