            ["L1","impregnableFortress"],
            ["L2","fortressEntrance","input swipe 650 250 650 900"]
        ],
        "_TIPS":"本任务是后续任务, 负责循环刷取: 反复刷门口的两只怪物和陷阱房的怪物.\n通常由\"[妖精]要塞八层门口\"检测到妖精杂物后自动切换过来, 也可以直接启动本任务.\n\n要塞8刷小精灵的准备流程:\n这是不回城的队伍, 因此推荐忍者盗贼面具+物理长矛/弓箭+王女或者夏莉莉奶.\n在\"设置setting\"\"自动移动auto-moving\"中关闭所有选项.\n\nThis is the follow-up task and performs the farming loop: repeatedly farm the two enemies at the entrance and the enemies in the trap room.\nIt is normally entered automatically after \"[Faerie] Fortress Zone 8\" detects the Faerie junk, but can also be started directly.\n\nPreparation for farming Faeries in Fortress Zone 8:\nSince this party does not return to town, Ninja, Rogue and Masked One, plus a physical spear/bow and Princess or Sheliri as healer, are recommended.\nIn \"Settings\" > \"Auto-Moving\", turn off all options."
    },
    	
